      </a>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.07em] text-red-700 sm:px-3 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(237,27,36,.10)]"></span>
        <span class="hidden xs:inline sm:inline">Request Error!</span>
      </span>
    </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="relative isolate flex flex-1 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_15%_20%,rgba(237,27,36,.055),transparent_30%),radial-gradient(circle_at_85%_80%,rgba(15,23,42,.045),transparent_32%),#f8fafc] px-3.5 py-14 sm:px-4 sm:py-[72px] sm:pb-20">

    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-[120px] -top-[90px] -z-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-red-200 opacity-20 blur-[90px]"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-[140px] -right-40 -z-10 h-[380px] w-[380px] rounded-full bg-slate-200 opacity-20 blur-[90px]"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-[45%] -z-10 h-[220px] w-[220px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-red-100 opacity-20 blur-[90px]"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-[760px] text-center">

      <div class="mb-2.5 text-[clamp(78px,23vw,148px)] font-extrabold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.075em] text-slate-900 sm:text-[clamp(88px,16vw,148px)]" id="errorCode">500</div>

      <h1 class="text-[clamp(25px,4vw,38px)] font-bold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-.035em] text-black/40" id="errorTitle">
        Something went wrong
      </h1>

      <p class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[620px] text-[clamp(14px,2vw,16px)] leading-[1.7] text-slate-500" id="errorMessage">
        We're sorry, but an unexpected error occurred while processing your request.
        Our team has been notified and is working on a fix.
      </p>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-[26px] flex w-full max-w-[600px] items-start gap-3 rounded-[14px] border border-slate-200/90 bg-white/85 p-3.5 text-left shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(15,23,42,.04)] sm:p-[15px_17px]">
        <i class="bi bi-info-circle mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand"></i>
        <div>
          <p class="mb-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-600">Error details</p>
          <code id="errorDetail" class="block break-words font-mono text-[11px] font-medium leading-[1.55] text-slate-500">Error: Something went wrong. Please try again later.</code>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-[30px] flex w-full max-w-[600px] flex-wrap justify-center gap-2.5 max-sm:grid max-sm:grid-cols-1">
        <a href="/error-reporting" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[11px] border border-transparent bg-slate-900 px-[18px] text-[13px] font-bold text-white no-underline shadow-[0_8px_20px_rgba(15,23,42,.12)] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-slate-800 hover:shadow-[0_12px_28px_rgba(15,23,42,.17)] max-sm:w-full">
          <i class="bi bi-hand-thumbs-down"></i>
          Report This
        </a>
        <button id="reloadBtn" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[11px] border border-slate-200 bg-white/75 px-[18px] text-[13px] font-bold text-slate-900 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white max-sm:w-full">
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i>
          Try Again
        </button>
        <a href="mailto:support@cococe.rw" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[11px] border border-slate-200 bg-white/75 px-[18px] text-[13px] font-bold text-slate-900 no-underline transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white max-sm:w-full">
          <i class="bi bi-person-raised-hand"></i>
          Support
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-[34px] grid w-full max-w-[600px] grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-4 sm:gap-2.5">
        <a href="/dashboard" class="group flex min-h-[70px] items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[13px] border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-2.5 text-center no-underline transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-red-200 hover:shadow-[0_10px_24px_rgba(15,23,42,.06)] sm:min-h-[76px] col-span-full">

          <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-brand">Go to Home page</span>

          <span class="text-lg text-brand leading-none">
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
